--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CONTENT & THIRD-PARTY ASSET LICENSING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Test Questions & Answers:
   - Source: Bundesamt für Migration und Flüchtlinge (BAMF), Germany.
   - Status: Official work (Amtliches Werk) under § 5 Abs. 1 of the German
     Copyright Act (Urheberrechtsgesetz - UrhG). Official catalogs of questions
     created for official examinations (Einbürgerungstest / Leben in Deutschland)
     are in the Public Domain (gemeinfrei).

2. Question Illustrations & Cached Images:
   - Source: Official graphical assets from the BAMF examination catalog,
     cached locally for offline study and high-availability rendering.
   - Status: Official works under § 5 Abs. 1 UrhG (Public Domain).

3. State Coats of Arms (Landeswappen der Bundesländer):
   - Source: Official state symbols of the 16 German federal states (Bundesländer),
     sourced via Wikimedia Commons.
   - Status: Public domain with respect to copyright (§ 5 Abs. 1 UrhG).
   - Usage Notice: State coats of arms are protected by administrative law
     (e.g., § 124 OWiG in Germany) against misuse or unauthorized representation
     of government authority. Their inclusion here is strictly for educational,
     civic identification, and test preparation purposes.
